# PanelPilot AI - Package Manager Configuration
#
# TLS Certificate Verification Policy:
# Insecure options such as 'strict-ssl=false' are strictly prohibited.
# In environments with local TLS interception (e.g. corporate security proxies or antivirus shields),
# configure Node to load OS trusted root certificates via the environment variable:
#   NODE_OPTIONS="--use-system-ca" (supported natively in Node.js v22.3.0+ and v24+)
# Or supply an explicit extra CA bundle via:
#   NODE_EXTRA_CA_CERTS=/path/to/ca-bundle.pem
#
# Do not commit machine-specific paths or disable verification.
